WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<v Nadia Roy>Sofia, thanks for joining. Let us talk about what online renewal means for the client support centre.</v>

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
<v Sofia Alvarez>Clients will call us when they cannot sign in with their GCKey, and right now my agents have never seen the new portal.</v>

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
<v Sofia Alvarez>Agents will need to look up application status in the case management system instead of emailing the processing team.</v>

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
<v Nadia Roy>Do you expect the number of calls to change?</v>

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
<v Sofia Alvarez>We expect call volumes to go up by maybe thirty percent in the first six weeks after launch.</v>

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Sofia Alvarez>Refund requests will move to an online form, so agents need to know how to walk clients through it step by step.</v>

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.000
<v Nadia Roy>And your scripts and articles?</v>

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:57.000
<v Sofia Alvarez>Our call scripts and the knowledge articles all have to be rewritten in English and French before launch.</v>

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
<v Sofia Alvarez>My supervisors will also need new reports, because the call reasons will be different from today.</v>

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.000
<v Nadia Roy>Great, thank you Sofia.</v>
